      "content": "i know i should probably see a doctor eventually but i just cant deal with this tooth pain right now. it's making it hard to sleep. the omeprazole is usually enough to keep the stomach stuff under control, so i was thinking maybe the ibuprofen won't be that big of a deal? like, if i just take a standard dose of advil, won't the omeprazole just protect my stomach from the ibuprofen? i really just need to know if i can take it tonight so i can get some rest.",
